<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks fell, four rose and six were flat in 32.4-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday, with the WIG 20 index closing virtually flat at 1,640.9 points.</p>
<p>The remaining six stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat at 142.5 zlotys in a 7.1-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
